<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 19/20.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 19/20.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Tuesday, May 20 on Monday. The</p>
<p>litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   20.05.97	  19.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5590	    6.5672</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3602	    2.3498</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.6038	    4.5886</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.4416	    3.4350</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5249	    0.5253</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7829	    0.7782</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2951	    0.2938</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0293	    7.0194</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6945	    0.6943</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2708	    1.2688</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
